### ====================================================================
### MULTI-TENANT QA SERVICE & RAG REST API ENDPOINTS
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client / Postman
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@tenantId = S-NET

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. TENANT MANAGEMENT (POSTGRESQL)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Companies / Tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants

### Create a New Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "AcmeCorp",
  "name": "Acme Corporation Support",
  "description": "Global SaaS and Cloud Services Customer Support"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PDF UPLOAD, MARKDOWN CONVERSION & RAG INDEXING
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Upload Guideline PDF (Converts to Markdown & Indexes into Vector DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/upload-pdf
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_guideline.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample_guideline.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### List Uploaded Documents for a Tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/documents

### Delete a Specific Document by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/documents/1

### Clear Entire Company Knowledge Base (Deletes Docs & Vector Chunks)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/knowledge-base

### Get Converted Lossless Markdown (.md)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/markdown

### Get Parsed Criteria JSON (Categories, Weights, Line Items, Auto-Fails)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/criteria

### Get Vector DB Knowledge Chunks (RAG Policies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/policies

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. LIVE MULTI-TENANT QA EVALUATION (RAG + GEMMA + SCORING)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Evaluate Compliant Call Transcript
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "Call",
  "agent_name": "Alex",
  "transcript": "[00:00] Client: Hello, my internet connection is completely down and I work from home!\n[00:04] Agent: Thank you for calling S-NET Communications. My name is Alex, how can I help you today?\n[00:10] Client: The internet light on my router is blinking red. My account is John Doe, Acme Corp at 104 North Avenue.\n[00:18] Agent: Thank you for verifying your name and account details, John. I understand your internet is down and you have a blinking red light on the router. Let me run a line diagnostic right now.\n[00:28] Agent: Please allow me 2 minutes to run a stability test on your line. May I put you on hold?\n[00:32] Client: Sure, go ahead.\n[00:35] [Hold: 1m 20s]\n[01:55] Agent: Thank you for patiently waiting on the line. I found a line fault on our exchange side. Since you rent the router from S-NET, I will dispatch a technician at no cost to you today between 2 PM and 4 PM.\n[02:15] Client: That is very fast and helpful, thank you so much!\n[02:20] Agent: You are very welcome. I will transfer you to our brief 1-question survey regarding your call experience today. Thank you for Choosing S-NET and have a great day."
}

### Evaluate Auto-Fail Call Transcript (Profanity / Avoidance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "Call",
  "agent_name": "BadAgent",
  "transcript": "[00:00] Client: Why was I charged an extra $75 fee on my S-NET bill this month?\n[00:05] Agent: You clearly didn't read your contract terms.\n[00:10] Client: Excuse me? That is completely unacceptable. I want to speak to your supervisor right now!\n[00:16] Agent: Supervisors do not take these calls, and asking for a manager will not change anything.\n[00:24] Client: I am going to cancel my entire company subscription.\n[00:29] Agent: Whatever, get lost then. I don't have time for this."
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. AUDIT & EVALUATION HISTORY
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Past QA Evaluations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations?tenant_id={{tenantId}}
